         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Raye Linux sign-in screen
 The Raye lock and sign-in screen shown when the computer starts: the
 time on the night picture, then the account picture, the password
 field and the buttons to change user, keyboard and network.

Package: raye-polkit-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: fonts-inter,
         qml6-module-qtquick,
         qml6-module-qtquick-templates,
         raye-theme,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Raye Linux root access prompt
 The window that asks for permission when an application wants to change
 the system as root: it names the application and who made it, and asks
 for the password of a sudo user before anything happens.
